tographs included.</td><td>No photographs included.</td><td>One cover image.</td><td>One cover and up to five products or services with an image.</td></tr><tr class="sim-price-row"><th scope="row">Price for the period</th><td><output data-sim-price="free" aria-live="polite">—</output></td><td><output data-sim-price="featured" aria-live="polite">—</output></td><td><output data-sim-price="page" aria-live="polite">—</output></td><td><output data-sim-price="page_premium" aria-live="polite">—</output></td></tr><tr class="sim-selection-row"><th scope="row">Choose your subscription</th><td><label><input type="radio" name="sim_subscription" value="free" aria-label="Free" checked><span>Free</span></label></td><td><label><input type="radio" name="sim_subscription" value="featured" aria-label="Featured"><span>Featured</span></label></td><td><label><input type="radio" name="sim_subscription" value="page" aria-label="Business Page"><span>Business Page</span></label></td><td><label><input type="radio" name="sim_subscription" value="page_premium" aria-label="Premium"><span>Premium</span></label></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="contact-visibility-note">Only information provided by your business and authorised for publication is displayed, according to the selected subscription.</p></div><div class="simulator-controls"><label>Subscription frequency<select data-sim-frequency><option value="monthly">Monthly</option><option value="quarterly">Quarterly</option><option value="semiannual">Semiannual</option><option value="annual">Annual</option></select></label><p data-sim-months></p><div data-sim-experiences hidden><h3>If you operate experiences</h3><label>Published experience<select data-sim-experience><option value="0">No add-on</option></select></label><p>Choose an experience your business provides. It must belong to the same place and requires the Experiences and activities category.</p><p>Optional add-on: <output data-sim-extra aria-live="polite">COP $0</output></p></div><p class="simulator-total">Total: <strong><output data-sim-total aria-live="polite">COP $0</output></strong></p><p id="tarifas-lanzamiento" class="notice simulator-pricing-note">Launch rates. Your contracted price is maintained throughout the paid period. Any change will be communicated before renewal.</p><a class="pill" data-sim-buy aria-disabled="true">I want this</a></div></section><p class="plans-note">✓ Included · — Not included. The directory is grouped by subscription: Commercial Page and Premium share the first section, followed by Featured and finally Free. The Premium star does not give additional priority over Commercial Page. Category filters apply to all groups. Limits are characters, including spaces and punctuation, not words.</p><section class="business-notice" id="operadores-experiencias" style="margin-block:32px"><p class="eyebrow">Optional add-on</p><h2>Appear as an experience operator</h2><p>Your subscription provides a directory listing. If your business has the category <strong>Experiences and activities</strong>, as its primary or an additional category, you can also purchase operator placement in a published experience in the same place.</p><ul><li>Requires Featured, Business Page or Premium. It is not sold separately or with Free.</li><li>Choose an experience your business actually provides. It must be published and belong to the same place as your business.</li><li>In addition to your directory listing, your business name appears within the experience with a link to your card or page, depending on your subscription.</li><li>Placement requires confirmed payment and approved publication. If the experience is unpublished, the advertisement stops appearing.</li></ul><?php SubscriptionPricingPresentation::operator($pricing['operator']); ?><p>This add-on provides operator visibility; it does not include bookings or guarantee sales or visitors.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/negocios-locales/proceso/#paginas">See how your business is presented →</a></section><section class="business-notice"><h2>From your account to publication</h2><p>Validating payment proof does not automatically publish the business. Its information and images are reviewed before publication is approved.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/negocios-locales/proceso/">How it works →</a></section><section class="section business-publication-terms" id="condiciones-de-publicacion"><h2>Before paying: review and activation</h2><ul><li>We will publish your business within five (5) business days after receiving payment. Saturdays, Sundays and Colombian public holidays are excluded. Before paying, provide the information and reference images required for your subscription.</li><li>The paid term starts when the subscription is approved and published, not when you transfer money or submit payment proof. Time spent awaiting publication does not consume the purchased term.</li><li>Before publication we review your relationship with the business, payment, information and applicable images. Submitting proof or confirming payment does not automatically publish the business or activate its benefits.</li><li>If payment proof is rejected, My account shows the reason and next step. If information or images need correction, publication remains pending and the paid term has not started.</li></ul><p>If publication ultimately proves impossible, we will explain why and handle your request for a resolution or refund under the contract and applicable rights.</p></section></main>
